# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (gitignored).
#
# This file is also what the Deploy to Cloudflare button reads: every live
# NAME=value below is asked for as a Worker secret during a one-click deploy, so
# it is kept to what a deployment genuinely needs. Commented lines are skipped.

# Signs session cookies. Use a real random value in production:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=local-dev-secret-change-me-0123456789abcdef

# Optional — the deployment uses its own origin when this is unset, which is what
# you want on a *.workers.dev URL. Set it only behind a custom domain.
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://relationship-manager.example.com

# Optional: lets the Connections screen sign in to Gmail / Google Calendar /
# Fathom and pull them from the cloud. Composio dashboard → API keys.
# COMPOSIO_API_KEY=ak_...

# Optional: permit specific addresses to create an account (comma separated).
# Without it, only the first account can ever be created.
# ALLOWED_EMAILS=you@example.com,them@example.com
